        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "EnWLt",
          "name": "BB",
          "fill": "$fg-subtle",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "The daily-driver dashboard — the decision cockpit: one screen, ~20 min, mobile.\n\nEntry: login → /dashboard (main authenticated home).\nScreens: Panorama (holdings overview) → Asset detail (drill-down). Desktop: master-detail (D4).\n\nBlocks: patrimonio MXN + today + sentiment · 'atención hoy' band · holdings list with semáforo + freshness · (detail) price chart (D2) + confluence semáforo (D3) + señales (RSI/MA/Bollinger) + observations + fundamentals.\n\nGrounding: real data — portfolio value, P&L (MXN, FX at trade), trend-score, RSI/SMA/Bollinger, technical_observations, fundamentals. Confluence engine (Light 2 + window) is design-only, build-gated (D3).\n\nCopy: es-MX. kit-version-source 0.1.0.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
    },
